OL,3,GNEWSA'I love the inclusivity of our
OL,4,Alearning disability running group'
OL,5,
OL,6,FGeorge, Dewni and Aaron love running -
OL,7,Fbut all three have additional needs
OL,8,Fthat have affected their access to the
OL,9,Fsport.
OL,11,FThanks to a running group for those
OL,12,Fwith learning disabilities, they have
OL,13,Fimproved their fitness, made friends
OL,14,Fand even entered races.
OL,16,FIn 2024, members of Ilkley Harriers
OL,17,Fstarting leading the group runs with
OL,18,Fjust three people - but they now have
OL,19,F13 regular participants for their jogs
OL,20,Faround the spa town at the edge of the
OL,21,FYorkshire Dales.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
